                Vieni a trovarci in Via dei Mercanti a Salerno.
            </h2>
            <p
                class="text-[0.95rem] text-white/70 mb-10 max-w-[620px] mx-auto leading-[1.8]"
                data-i18n="cta.desc"
            >
                Scopri le collezioni in negozio in Via dei Mercanti 131 o ordina
                comodamente via WhatsApp con spedizione 24/48h.
            </p>
            <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap">
                <a
                    href="/collezione"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 bg-gold text-navy-dark rounded-full text-[0.74rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase hover:bg-gold-light transition-all duration-300 min-h-[50px] hover:scale-105 shadow-lg"
                    data-i18n="cta.collection_btn">Esplora la Collezione</a
                >
                <a
                    href="/acquista"
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/40 rounded-full text-[0.74rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition-all duration-300 min-h-[50px] hover:scale-105"
                    data-i18n="cta.location_btn">Dove Siamo &amp; Contatti</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
